<title>MALTA: PRESS DIGEST - Malta - Dec 24.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Malta - Dec 24.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Maltese press on Tuesday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>THE TIMES</p>
<p>- Government appoints commission to study setting up a Family Court.</p>
<p>L-ORIZZONT</p>
<p>- Government considering proposals from constitutional bodies on new tax system to replace Value Added Tax. It is expected to be revealed when Finance Minister Lino Spiteri presents his budget in January.</p>
<p>IN-NAZZJON</p>
<p>- Greek Foreign Minister expected to visit Malta next month.</p>
